87"},{"t":60,"c":"Overcast","w":"11","p":".0","h":"80"},{"t":63,"c":"Overcast","w":"10","p":".0","h":"78"}],"notes":"Griffith focused on detail work and tying bar between the hollow core panels. UCI stripped wall 32A and set forms on wall 32B, while MJE set forms on wall 45B and the valve vault. The dirt crews placed millings across the site. Ironhorse stripped the stem wall on the electrical building and set forms for the stem wall on the DVO buildings. DVO installed poly and continued fabricating HDPE, and Bennett continued backfilling, fabricating, and welding HDPE pipe. We did receive a shipment of the nuform walls for the building","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-10-24.png","sigTs":1761422220000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-10-25","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2025-10-25","by":"Bryan Ricca","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-25-00.jpg","ts":1761410400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-25-01.jpg","ts":1761416880000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-25-02.jpg","ts":1761416880000,"cap":""}],"att":[],"wx":[{"t":56,"c":"Rain, Overcast","w":"3","p":".04","h":"97"},{"t":56,"c":"Rain, Overcast","w":"6","p":".12","h":"97"},{"t":55,"c":"Rain, Overcast","w":"8","p":".03","h":"96"}],"notes":"The job site was completely \ufb02ooded with water due to continuous rain throughout Saturday, preventing all crews from working except for DVO. DVO completed the installation of the last six HDPE pipes in the acid chambers, making them ready to be connected to the building","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-10-25.png","sigTs":1761442800000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-10-27","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2025-10-27","by":"Bryan Ricca","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-27-00.jpg","ts":17