 stem wall for the DVO buildings, and","subs":[{"name":"DVO continued welding","items":""}],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-10-28.png","sigTs":1761843180000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-10-29","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2025-10-29","by":"Bryan Ricca","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-00.jpg","ts":1761774480000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-01.jpg","ts":1761774480000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-02.jpg","ts":1761774480000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-03.jpg","ts":1761778140000,"cap":""}],"att":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-04.jpg","ts":1761778140000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-05.jpg","ts":1761779400000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-06.jpg","ts":1761780720000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-07.jpg","ts":1761791220000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-29-08.jpg","ts":1761858960000,"cap":""}],"wx":[{"t":39,"c":"Clear","w":"20","p":".0","h":"66"},{"t":50,"c":"Clear","w":"27","p":".0","h":"40"},{"t":55,"c":"Clear","w":"20","p":".0","h":"32"}],"notes":"Griffith tied bar on slab 7A and at the sump pits. UCI stripped walls 32B and 45B and formed the sump pit.\nMJE prepped slab 7A and formed around the exterior curb. The dirt crews also prepped slab 7A and worked on roads and drainage. Ironhorse stripped the stem wall for the DVO building and prepped the stem wall for the DVO office building, while DVO installed DVO & continued welding racks","subs":[],"survey":[{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""},{"a":"N/A","d":""}],"sig":"raken/sig/2025-10-29.png","sigTs":1761924840000,"source":"Raken PDF"},{"id":"raken-bluesky-2025-10-30","pid":"raken-bluesky","date":"2025-10-30","by":"Bryan Ricca","site":[{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-30-00.jpg","ts":1761846180000,"cap":""},{"url":"raken/photos/2025-10-30-01.j